{"id":1206,"level":64,"name":"Захист від шаху","group":"Мат","format":35,"description":"<p>If your king is in check, you have a problem to solve. A king can never stay in check. This means that you have to do something to get your king out of check.</p>  <p><br />Ways to get out of check are:</p>  <ul>  <li><strong>Moving</strong>. Move your king to a safe square.</li>  <li><strong>Blocking</strong>. Protect your king by placing another piece between your king and the piece that gives check.</li>  <li><strong>Capturing</strong>. Take the piece that is checking your king.</li>  </ul>  <p><br /><strong>What do you have to do?</strong><br />Your (white) king is in check. Play the best move to get out of check.</p>","assignment":"","stickerID":12,"examples":[{"fen":"4k3/8/8/8/4b3/8/8/7K w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Gg1,Rg2,Gh2][%cal Ye4h1]} 1. Kh2 (1. Kg1) *","text":"","format":35},{"fen":"4k3/8/8/8/2n5/8/4q3/4K3 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Re2]} 1. Kxe2 *","text":"","format":35},{"fen":"K1q4k/PR6/8/8/8/8/8/8 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%cal Rc8a8]} 1. Rb8 *","text":"","format":35},{"fen":"8/8/8/8/4b3/7k/8/7K w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Gg1,Rg2,Rh2][%cal Ye4h1]} 1. Kg1 *","text":"","format":35}],"puzzles":[{"id":41592,"fen":"4k3/8/8/8/4b3/8/8/7K w - - 0 0","pgn":"{[%cal Re4h1]} {Q=1} 1. Kh2 (1. Kg1) *","format":35,"texts":["Уникнути перевірки."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":41602,"fen":"3k4/8/8/8/8/8/8/q1K5 w - - 0 0","pgn":"{[%csl Gc2,Gd2][%cal Ra1c1]} {Q=1} 1. Kc2 (1. Kd2) *","format":35,"texts":["Уникнути перевірки."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":41607,"fen":"K1q4k/P7/8/8/4Q3/8/8/2R5 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%cal Rc8a8]} {Q=1} 1. Rxc8+ *","format":35,"texts":["Затримайте нападника!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":41604,"fen":"k6q/8/8/8/8/8/8/K7 w - - 0 0","pgn":"{[%cal Rh8a1,Ga1b1,Ga1a2]} {Q=1} 1. Ka2 (1. Kb1) *","format":35,"texts":["Уникнути перевірки."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":41596,"fen":"8/8/4k3/2b5/3K4/8/4b3/8 w 